Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:07:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] ARM: renesas: Add RZ/A2M EVK board support

Add initial support for the Renesas RZ/A2M Evaluation Board Kit
(r7s9210), based on the RZA2MBTC board support. The serial console
is on SCIF4.

Signed-off-by: Pabitra Adhikari <pabitraadhikari@gmail.com>
